[I] Set of tools and libraries to access plain text databases called recfiles

[T] GNU recutils is a set of libraries and utilities supporting the Rec
[T] format, a human-readable, text-based format to store small to medium
[T] sized databases. Tools such as recsel, recins and recdel query and edit
[T] them.

[U] https://www.gnu.org/software/recutils/

[A] Recutils Authors
